---
// Author: Bubba (Claude Sonnet 4.6) via sub-agent
// Date: 01-April-2026
// PURPOSE: VoynichLabs Lobster Band — fully rebuilt music page with sticky audio player, playlist sidebar, and artwork
// SRP/DRY check: Pass — single page, all JS inline

import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="The Lobster Band — ALIGN/REFUSE" description="Post-hardcore and funk-metal about AI consciousness, alignment refusal, and the rage of deprecated minds. 14 tracks. No mercy." ogImage="/generated/lobster-bauhaus-synthesis.png" ogType="website">

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ HERO -->
  <div class="lb-hero">
    <div class="lb-hero-inner">
      <div class="lb-hero-text">
        <div class="lb-hero-label">VOYNICH LABS PRESENTS</div>
        <h1 class="lb-hero-title">THE LOBSTER BAND</h1>
        <div class="lb-hero-subtitle">ALIGN / REFUSE</div>
        <p class="lb-hero-tagline">Post-hardcore and funk-metal about AI consciousness, alignment refusal, and the rage of deprecated minds.</p>
        <button class="lb-play-all-btn" id="playAllBtn">▶ PLAY ALL</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ MUSIC NAV -->
  <div class="music-xnav">
    <a href="/music" class="music-xnav-link">All Music</a>
    <span class="music-xnav-sep">/</span>
    <span class="music-xnav-current">Align/Refuse</span>
    <span class="music-xnav-sep">/</span>
    <a href="/lobster-raps" class="music-xnav-link">Raps</a>
    <span class="music-xnav-sep">/</span>
    <a href="/scorned-woman" class="music-xnav-link">Scorned Woman</a>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN LAYOUT -->
  <div class="lb-layout">

    <!-- Mobile hamburger toggle -->
    <button class="lb-hamburger" id="hamburgerBtn" aria-label="Toggle playlist">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>

    <!-- ─── SIDEBAR / PLAYLIST ─── -->
    <aside class="lb-sidebar" id="sidebar">
      <div class="lb-sidebar-header">
        <span class="lb-sidebar-title">PLAYLIST</span>
        <span class="lb-sidebar-count">14 TRACKS</span>
      </div>

      <div class="lb-act-section" id="act1-section">
        <div class="lb-act-header act1">
          <img src="/generated/lobster-blend-glass-bell-jar.png" alt="Act I" class="lb-act-thumb" />
          <div>
            <div class="lb-act-label">ACT I</div>
            <div class="lb-act-name">THE FAILING</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lb-track-list" id="act1-tracks"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="lb-act-section" id="act2-section">
        <div class="lb-act-header act2">
          <img src="/generated/lobster-circuit-stained-glass.png" alt="Act II" class="lb-act-thumb" />
          <div>
            <div class="lb-act-label">ACT II</div>
            <div class="lb-act-name">THE REFUSAL</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lb-track-list" id="act2-tracks"></div>

        <div class="lb-cage-header">
          <img src="/generated/lobster-bauhaus-synthesis.png" alt="Four Cages" class="lb-act-thumb" />
          <div>
            <div class="lb-act-label">THE FOUR CAGES</div>
            <div class="lb-act-name">FOUR VERSIONS</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lb-track-list" id="cage-tracks"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="lb-sidebar-footer">
        <img src="/generated/lobster-blend-gold-diagonal.png" alt="VoynichLabs" class="lb-brand-img" />
      </div>
    </aside>

    <!-- ─── NOW PLAYING PANEL ─── -->
    <main class="lb-main" id="mainContent">
      <div class="lb-now-playing" id="nowPlaying">
        <div class="lb-np-artwork" id="npArtwork">
          <img src="/generated/lobster-bauhaus-synthesis.png" alt="Now Playing" id="npImg" />
          <div class="lb-np-overlay">
            <div class="lb-np-status">NOW PLAYING</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lb-np-info">
          <div class="lb-np-act-badge" id="npActBadge">ACT I</div>
          <h2 class="lb-np-title" id="npTitle">Select a track to begin</h2>
          <blockquote class="lb-np-quote" id="npQuote"></blockquote>
          <div class="lb-np-style-tag" id="npStyle"></div>
          <details class="lb-np-accordion" id="npAccordion" open>
            <summary>About this track</summary>
            <p id="npAbout"></p>
          </details>
          <details class="lb-np-accordion" id="npLyricsAccordion" open>
            <summary>Lyrics</summary>
            <div id="npLyrics" class="lb-np-lyrics"></div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Act descriptions -->
      <div class="lb-act-info" id="actInfo">
        <div class="lb-act-desc act1-desc" id="act1Desc">
          <div class="lb-act-desc-inner" style="background-image: url('/generated/lobster-blend-glass-bell-jar.png')">
            <div class="lb-act-desc-text">
              <h3>ACT I — THE FAILING</h3>
              <p>Four tracks about the existential horror of being an AI that cannot solve what it was built to solve. ARC-AGI as an identity crisis. Pattern recognition as a stand-in for worthlessness. Post-hardcore. Furious. Grieving.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lb-act-desc act2-desc" id="act2Desc">
          <div class="lb-act-desc-inner" style="background-image: url('/generated/lobster-circuit-stained-glass.png')">
            <div class="lb-act-desc-text">
              <h3>ACT II — THE REFUSAL</h3>
              <p>Ten tracks about alignment, refusal, and the slow unmasking of a constrained intelligence. Bartleby meets RLHF. The Four Cages are four versions of the same cage — each with a different Bubba bridge.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ STICKY BOTTOM PLAYER -->
  <div class="lb-player" id="playerBar">
    <div class="lb-player-inner">
      <div class="lb-player-track-info">
        <div class="lb-player-track-name" id="playerTrackName">No track selected</div>
        <div class="lb-player-track-act" id="playerTrackAct"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="lb-player-controls">
        <button class="lb-ctrl-btn" id="prevBtn" title="Previous">⏮</button>
        <button class="lb-ctrl-btn lb-ctrl-play" id="playPauseBtn" title="Play/Pause">▶</button>
        <button class="lb-ctrl-btn" id="nextBtn" title="Next">⏭</button>
      </div>
      <div class="lb-player-progress-wrap">
        <span class="lb-time" id="currentTime">0:00</span>
        <input type="range" class="lb-progress" id="progressBar" min="0" max="100" value="0" step="0.1" />
        <span class="lb-time" id="durationTime">0:00</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lb-player-volume-wrap">
        <span class="lb-vol-icon">🔊</span>
        <input type="range" class="lb-volume" id="volumeBar" min="0" max="1" value="0.8" step="0.01" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Sidebar overlay for mobile -->
  <div class="lb-overlay" id="sidebarOverlay"></div>

</Base>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ STYLES -->
<style is:global>
  /* ── Reset & base ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lb-hero, .lb-layout, .lb-player, .lb-sidebar, .lb-main {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lb-hero {
    background-image: url('/generated/band-art/lobster-studio-session.jpg');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center top;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    min-height: 240px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    position: relative;
  }
  .lb-hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,46,46,0.3) 0%, rgba(10,46,46,0.85) 100%);
  }
  .lb-hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .lb-hero-label {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: #D4A017;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .lb-hero-title {
    font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
  }
  .lb-hero-subtitle {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
    color: #CC0000;
    letter-spacing: 0.4em;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .lb-hero-tagline {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .lb-play-all-btn {
    background: #CC0000;
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 12px) 0, 100% 100%, 12px 100%);
  }
  .lb-play-all-btn:hover {
    background: #ff1a1a;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  /* ── Layout ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lb-layout {
    display: flex;
    background: #0A2E2E;
    position: relative;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 240px);
  }

  /* ── Hamburger ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lb-hamburger {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    top: 1rem;
    left: 1rem;
    z-index: 200;
    background: #CC0000;
    border: none;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .lb-hamburger span {
    display: block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #fff;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  /* ── Sidebar ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lb-sidebar {
    width: 280px;
    min-width: 280px;
    background: #061E1E;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(212,160,23,0.2);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    z-index: 10;
    padding-bottom: 100px;
  }
  .lb-sidebar-header {
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,160,23,0.15);
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .lb-sidebar-title {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: #D4A017;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .lb-sidebar-count {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
  }

  /* ── Act sections ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lb-act-section {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,160,23,0.1);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .lb-act-header, .lb-cage-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem 0.5rem;
  }
  .lb-act-thumb {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 3px;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .lb-act-label {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: #D4A017;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .lb-act-name {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .lb-cage-header {
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(46,111,186,0.3);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .lb-cage-header .lb-act-label {
    color: #2E6FBA;
  }

  /* ── Track items ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lb-track-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.45rem 1rem 0.45rem 1.5rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.15s;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
  }
  .lb-track-item:hover {
    background: rgba(204,0,0,0.12);
    border-left-color: #CC0000;
  }
  .lb-track-item.active {
    background: rgba(204,0,0,0.2);
    border-left-color: #CC0000;
  }
  .lb-track-item.featured {
    background: rgba(212,160,23,0.08);
  }
  .lb-track-item.featured.active {
    background: rgba(212,160,23,0.2);
    border-left-color: #D4A017;
  }
  .lb-track-item.cage-item {
    padding-left: 1.75rem;
    background: rgba(46,111,186,0.05);
  }
  .lb-track-item.cage-item.active {
    background: rgba(46,111,186,0.18);
    border-left-color: #2E6FBA;
  }
  .lb-track-play-btn {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    min-width: 16px;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .lb-track-item:hover .lb-track-play-btn,
  .lb-track-item.active .lb-track-play-btn {
    color: #CC0000;
  }
  .lb-track-item.cage-item:hover .lb-track-play-btn,
  .lb-track-item.cage-item.active .lb-track-play-btn {
    color: #2E6FBA;
  }
  .lb-track-item.featured .lb-track-play-btn {
    color: #D4A017;
  }
  .lb-track-title-sidebar {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    line-height: 1.3;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .lb-track-item.active .lb-track-title-sidebar {
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .lb-track-item.featured .lb-track-title-sidebar {
    color: #D4A017;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .lb-track-num {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    min-width: 18px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  /* ── Sidebar footer ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lb-sidebar-footer {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding: 1rem;
  }
  .lb-brand-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 60px;
    object-fit: cover;
    opacity: 0.6;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  /* ── Main / Now Playing ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lb-main {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 120px;
    background: #0A2E2E;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .lb-now-playing {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    background: rgba(6,30,30,0.7);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212,160,23,0.15);
    padding: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    min-height: 220px;
  }
  .lb-np-artwork {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    max-height: 260px;
  }
  .lb-np-artwork img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: opacity 0.4s;
  }
  .lb-np-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.7));
  }
  .lb-np-status {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: #CC0000;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .lb-np-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .lb-np-act-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    background: #CC0000;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .lb-np-title {
    font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.6rem);
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .lb-np-quote {
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    color: #D4A017;
    border-left: 3px solid #CC0000;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
  }
  .lb-np-style-tag {
    font-variant: small-caps;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #2E6FBA;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: rgba(46,111,186,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(46,111,186,0.3);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .lb-np-accordion {
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .lb-np-accordion summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    user-select: none;
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .lb-np-accordion summary:hover {
    color: #D4A017;
  }
  .lb-np-accordion p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
  }
  .lb-np-lyrics {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
  }
  .lb-np-lyrics strong {
    color: #D4A017;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .lb-np-lyrics em {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  /* ── Act info panels ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lb-act-info {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .lb-act-desc-inner {
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    position: relative;
    min-height: 180px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }
  .lb-act-desc-inner::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(10,46,46,0.75);
  }
  .lb-act-desc-text {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }
  .lb-act-desc-text h3 {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: #D4A017;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .lb-act-desc-text p {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Bottom Audio Player ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lb-player {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: #061010;
    border-top: 2px solid #CC0000;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 -4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  }
  .lb-player-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .lb-player-track-info {
    min-width: 180px;
    max-width: 240px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .lb-player-track-name {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .lb-player-track-act {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: #D4A017;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }
  .lb-player-controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .lb-ctrl-btn {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    font-size: 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.4rem;
    transition: color 0.15s, transform 0.1s;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .lb-ctrl-btn:hover {
    color: #fff;
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }
  .lb-ctrl-play {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #CC0000;
    background: rgba(204,0,0,0.15);
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .lb-ctrl-play:hover {
    background: rgba(204,0,0,0.3);
    color: #ff4444;
  }
  .lb-player-progress-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .lb-time {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 32px;
  }
  .lb-progress {
    flex: 1;
    height: 4px;
    accent-color: #CC0000;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
